# Optional. Nothing here is required: with nothing set, the app derives its
# address from the machine already serving it the bundle, which is where
# `npm run mock` is listening. A fresh clone runs with no configuration.
#
# Set this to point the app at a real backend - a staging host, a branch
# deployment, a backend you are writing yourself. When it is set it always
# wins.
#
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://api.example.com/api/v1
#
# Two endpoints are not part of the contract: the option lists and image
# upload. A server can satisfy the contract in full and still not serve them.
# Set this to keep those two on the mock server while everything else goes to
# the real one. Left unset, it follows the address above and the app talks to
# a single server.
#
# EXPO_PUBLIC_STANDIN_API_URL=http://192.168.1.24:4000/api/v1
